{"ID":"20240522082232-ows5wxt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082232-ows5wxt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082232-ows5wxt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522104416-h8w51t2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522104417-fu7ammr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522104423-hmjz0wh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"陳醫師的甲狀腺機能亢進案","type":"doc","updated":"20240522104423"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522104416-h8w51t2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-h8w51t2","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甲狀腺機能亢進"}]},{"ID":"20240522104416-ef7tzcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-ef7tzcq","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林＊＊，女，39歲，屏東縣人"}]},{"ID":"20240522104416-jozdvxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-jozdvxf","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診98/9/9,續診：9/16、22、24、30,10/7、14、21、28,11/4、11、18、25,12/2、14、23、30,99/1/6"}]},{"ID":"20240522104416-11x4m2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-11x4m2y","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"症狀：右面部顏面麻木，西醫診斷甲狀腺高亢，服西藥中，納佳，汗出多，手抖，大便一日三四行，便稀水，小便色淡黃，心悸，職業是老師，壓力大，易胃痛，眠差，多夢，舌紅絳苔白微厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104416-on0b53p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-on0b53p","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左脈：浮弦濇數，右脈：浮弦數。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104416-gxihxcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-gxihxcr","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"科中處方：炙甘草湯8、葛根1、鬱金1.5、茯神1、酸棗仁1.5、當歸1。二診：炙甘草湯7、五味子1、鬱金1.5、茯神1、炮附子1、當歸1、黃芩0.5、黃連0.5。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104416-uh7b9l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-uh7b9l6","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"往後以炙甘草湯加芩連為主加減。至99/1/6後，因左肩酸痛來診，患者自述，心跳回復正常70-80,體重增加3-4公斤，自覺已痊癒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104423-hmjz0wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104423-hmjz0wh"}},{"ID":"20240522104416-htkruw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-htkruw2","updated":"20240522104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記敍：患者初診時，停服西藥，用中藥治療，一段時間後回診西醫，剛好負責醫師出國，由其它醫師代診，那時醫生問體重增加多少，患者說一公斤，醫師說服這藥，不應該只胖一公斤，患者說：我沒有吃藥，醫師：沒吃藥，只會更瘦，怎麼可能會胖呢？患者：我吃中藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104416-xizr7i1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104416-xizr7i1","updated":"20240522104420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"弟子陳醫師報告至此。"}]},{"ID":"20240522104417-fu7ammr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522104417-fu7ammr"}}]}